use two weeks prior to surgery."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Notice: Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"Informed-Choice.org Trusted by sport"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Products bearing this logo have been tested for banned substances by LGC Science, Inc., a world-class anti-doping lab. Product was tested for over 145 banned substances on the 2014 World Anti-Doping Agency (WADA) Prohibited List via LGC skip lot testing protocol #ICP0307. See gnc.com for more information."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"The benefits of Creatine Advance XR\nGNC's superior Pro Performance Creatine Advance XR product is a dual-release formula with technology-enhancement that extends the release of creatine, a key building block shown to support improved strength and performance.  GNC's recently created Optimal Timing Technology-OT2- was designed for immediate and 6 hr sustained release creatine."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Creatine provides support for energy production during exercise and helps your muscles make and circulate ATP for quick, intense activity."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"OT2-The GNC advantage\nOT2 is GNC's intelligent nutrient delivery system engineered to help release key ingredients during crucial times when you need them most!"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"These breakthrough products are designed to deliver immediate and sustained release of ingredients to help maintain benefits throughout your workout, day or night."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"OT2 ingredients are coated with a special technology that controls when they are released."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"These special activities may be seen in the product - now that's real technology you can see and feel! With the introduction of the unique, sustained-release technology, now muscle-fueling creatine is released for up to six hours!"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"NItro-Factor - maximize muscle building"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"The full muscle-building potential of a GNC product is based on its total nitrogen content-so the more nitrogen a product has, the stronger it will perform. Nitrogen needs increase during training, and if nitrogen levels are low, your body pulls from muscle stores which can result in catabolism, poor performance adn longer recovery."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"To fuel performance and anabolism, Pro Performance Creatine Advance XR is loaded with 10 grams of nitrogen-boosting ingredients."},{"type":"FDA Disclaimer Statement","notes":"These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 11957 7","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}